      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A carved wooden bas-relief of this raven. Shallow relief carved into a flat walnut panel. Crisp chisel-cut planes and visible tool marks. Matte unpolished wood, completely non-reflective. Hard raking light from the upper left casting sharp dark shadows inside the carved grooves and along every carved edge. Each feather is a distinct carved step with a defined edge. Keep the exact pose, silhouette and proportions. The background is the flat uncarved panel surface, one uniform tone, edge to edge. No gloss, no shine, no colour variation, no wood grain figure."
      ]
    },
